flowchart LR
  accTitle: Feedback review flow
  accDescr: Feedback items move from New to Triaged to Planned to Resolved, with a reopen path back to Triaged.
  new[New] --> triaged[Triaged]
  triaged --> planned[Planned]
  planned --> resolved[Resolved]
  resolved -. reopen .-> triaged
  triaged --> more{Needs more info?}
  more -- yes --> new
